   "id": "omaboot.applesmc-led-container-of",
   "name": "applesmc keyboard backlight fix",
   "changes": "Fixes an oops while applesmc starts on Macs whose SMC has a keyboard-backlight key: t2linux patch 3001 takes the SMC's data from the backlight's LED device, which doesn't hold it. A one-line container_of fix. With it, fans, the light sensor and the keyboard backlight work in a live boot.",
   "hardware": "Macs without a T2 chip whose SMC has a keyboard-backlight key, booted on OmaBoot?'s T2 kernel (linux-t2), which carries the t2linux applesmc patches. Other Macs load it without harm.",
